<title>USA: American HomePatient makes acquisitions.</title>
<headline>American HomePatient makes acquisitions.</headline>
<dateline>BRENTWOOD, Tenn. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>American HomePatient Inc said on Wednesday it acquired Choice Health Services Inc and Home Medical Services Inc for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>Choice Health Services is based in Cumberland, Md., with annual revenues of $2.3 million. Home Medical Services, headquartered in Alexander City, Ala., has revenues of about $1.4 million.</p>
<p>Since January 1, American HomePatient has bought seven health-care companies, with total revenues of $18.3 million.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
